QuestLog MK2

QuestLog is a gamified productivity and personal project management system that transforms everyday goals into quests. Inspired by RPG mechanics, QuestLog integrates AI assistants, a quest board, and persistent storage to make organizing life both fun and engaging.

🎯 Goals

      Gamify Productivity: Turn real-world tasks into quests with levels, rewards, and progression.

      AI Integration: Use AI agents as quest givers, guides, and chat companions.

      Cross-Device Persistence: Store quests and user progress in Supabase, accessible from any device.

      Customizable Tools: Provide extensible toolbars where new functions and AI personalities can be added.

      User Engagement: Deliver a clean, interactive UI that makes task management feel like a game.

🛠️ Development Process

      Frontend Setup

            Built using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.

            Includes sections for the Elevator (floors/projects), Room (AI chat + tools), and Quests (active quest list + add quest form).

            Styled with a clean UI layout, modular components, and hover states for interactive buttons.

      Quest Management System

            Quests are stored and retrieved from Supabase (quests table).

            Features include:

            Adding new quests.

            Completing/removing quests.

            Auto-refreshing the quest board on updates.

      AI Integration

            Backend built with Flask (Agent1.py) to handle chat requests.

            Uses OpenAI GPT-4o-mini to generate witty, helpful AI responses.

            Frontend (script.js) communicates with the Python agent through a REST API at http://localhost:5000/chat .

      User Data Persistence

            User profiles (username, level, quests) are synced with Supabase.

            Data is also cached in localStorage for faster UI updates.

      Interactive UI

            AI agents dynamically load their names, descriptions, and available tools into the toolbar.

            Quests are displayed in cards with title, description, and completion buttons.

            Hidden forms (like the Add Quest form) toggle on demand for smooth UX.

📖 Features

      AI Chat: Interact with Agent1 or future AI personalities as if they were NPC quest givers.

      Quest Board: Create, view, and complete quests.

      Persistent Storage: Quests tied to user accounts in Supabase.

      Leveling System (Planned): Track XP and level progression.

      Multiple Floors (Planned): Organize projects across different themed floors (e.g., Executive, Library, Workshop).